"cd ~/\n"
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all    # Python 3.12 env; installs ros2_robot_interface"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md:20
#: b27c7ca3697544bf9ad3b32e7be62118
msgid ""
"`./init.sh all` initializes submodules, creates the env, and installs the"
" Python packages. Then use `./run.sh` (or `./run.sh viser`) for "
"launchers."
msgstr ""
"`./init.sh all` 会初始化子模块、创建环境并安装 Python 包。然后用 `./run.sh`（或 `./run.sh "
"viser`）启动。"

