msgid "With Viser Visualization"
msgstr "结合 Viser 可视化"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md:125
#: d53f187950414c058494bd0399a1b207
msgid ""
"Launch Viser from **fa-py-libraries** (`./run.sh viser`). That is the "
"primary entry; do not start it from lerobot_ros2 or treat `pip install "
"ros2-viser` as the product launcher."
msgstr ""
"从 **fa-py-libraries** 启动 Viser（`./run.sh viser`）。这是主入口；不要从 lerobot_ros2 "
"启动，也不要把 `pip install ros2-viser` 当成产品启动方式。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md:127
#: af380ca6b27047fba21a37c048acc8ab
msgid ""
"cd ~/fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh viser"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh viser"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md:132
#: 5a3011b3632044c88f0aebcf0a7c8ee1
msgid ""
"`ros2_viser` is a library dependency of that command. Embedding "
"`ROS2ViserVisualizer` in your own script is covered on "
"[ros2-viser](../../4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md)."
msgstr ""
"`ros2_viser` 是该命令的库依赖。在自己的脚本里嵌入 `ROS2ViserVisualizer` 见 [ros2-viser](../../4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md:134
#: e229eb991694471685c7c63e6b115254
msgid "FSM Commands"
msgstr "FSM 命令"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md:136
#: db1f586957b7418d984855983c94f9d6
msgid ""
"`/fsm_command` is **`std_msgs/Int32`** (not strings such as `stand` / "
"`walk`). Values and legal transitions depend on the running controller. "
"See [FSM and Topics](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md)."
msgstr ""
"`/fsm_command` 是 **`std_msgs/Int32`**（不是 `stand` / `walk` 这类字符串）。取值与合法转换取决于正在运行的控制器。见 [FSM 与话题](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md:138
#: 2e6f1149b0db41b7bf56081e0fb67700
msgid "Async Interface"
msgstr "异步接口"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md:140
#: fb457d073f264125b8c4a47637520705
msgid "For non-blocking operations:"
msgstr "用于非阻塞操作："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md:142
#: c5a9765aef6d462a9a5d3378f6080be1
msgid ""
"import asyncio\n"
"from ros2_robot_interface import AsyncRobotInterface\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    robot = AsyncRobotInterface()\n"
"    await robot.connect()\n"
"    \n"
"    # Non-blocking motion\n"
"    await robot.move_j_async([0.0, -0.5, 0.5, 0.0, 0.5, 0.0])\n"
"    \n"
"    # Do other things while moving\n"
"    while robot.is_moving():\n"
"        print(\"Moving...\")\n"
"        await asyncio.sleep(0.1)\n"
"    \n"
"    print(\"Done!\")\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())"
msgstr ""
"import asyncio\n"
"from ros2_robot_interface import AsyncRobotInterface\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    robot = AsyncRobotInterface()\n"
"    await robot.connect()\n"
"    \n"
"    # Non-blocking motion\n"
"    await robot.move_j_async([0.0, -0.5, 0.5, 0.0, 0.5, 0.0])\n"
"    \n"
"    # Do other things while moving\n"
"    while robot.is_moving():\n"
"        print(\"Moving...\")\n"
"        await asyncio.sleep(0.1)\n"
"    \n"
"    print(\"Done!\")\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())"

